# Always More Quoth the Ravenous (adoulin, call-only), the talk's needToZone gate: a level 99 Warrior in
# Western Adoulin, Hunger Strikes and The Starving completed (GMs), 125 Adoulin fame; Raptor Rapture accepted at
# Raptor_Rapture_Status 8 (GMs). Pagnelle: 5039, finished: Raptor Rapture completed and needToZone (the only statement
# that sets it). Westerly Breeze (pairs: 553, then his script), needing to zone: nothing from the script. After a
# rezone: 3010, finished: added.
lists WesternAdoulin/Westerly_Breeze/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/Pagnelle/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/5039 WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/3010
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=63.5,32,123 job=WAR lvl=99
fame Adoulin 125
quest Adoulin.HungerStrikes completed
quest Adoulin.TheStarving completed
quest Adoulin.RaptorRapture accepted
charvar Raptor_Rapture_Status 8
login
trigger Pagnelle                        # Raptor Rapture at status 8: 5039
finish                                  # completed, needToZone
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # 553
finish-if-event
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # needing to zone: nothing: 553
finish-if-event
rezone
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # 553
finish-if-event
trigger Westerly_Breeze                 # zoned: 3010
finish-if-event                         # added
